  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Financing Facility - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enable innovative and efficient financing of family planning and broader sexual and reproductive health; increasing private sector and domestic resource allocations in countries, focussing initially in Nigeria and Mozambique and mainly to increased access to quality, comprehensive family planning and women&#x2019;s, children&#x2019;s and adolescents&#x2019; health in at least 3 countries.  The lessons learnt from it will help many more countries to increase financing for these services in the longer term.</narrative>
  </description>
